<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13575] Invalid blocking section in GridNioWorker and GridNioClientWorker leads to false positive blocking thread detection</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13575</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If &lt;tt&gt;IGNITE_SYSTEM_WORKER_BLOCKED_TIMEOUT&lt;/tt&gt; less than 2000 ms, then simple &lt;tt&gt;epoll_wait&lt;/tt&gt; for 2000 on idle cluster is considered as critical failure. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should surround &lt;tt&gt;selector.select&lt;/tt&gt; with &lt;tt&gt;blockingSectionBegin&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;blockingSectionEnd&lt;/tt&gt; instead of &lt;tt&gt;updateHeartbeat&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
